WEBVTT

01:30.890 --> 01:34.970
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.020 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 27]

01:38.150 --> 01:38.789
Sir.

01:38.289 --> 01:41.120
[Mr. Bai Shi'an's Tomb]

01:39.430 --> 01:41.090
You heard everything, right?

01:41.710 --> 01:42.560
Rest assured.

01:43.690 --> 01:44.840
Yimei has Heaven on her side.

01:44.840 --> 01:45.770
She will be fine.

01:47.310 --> 01:48.910
Mother and I are leaving now.

01:50.150 --> 01:51.610
When we have news of Yimei,

01:52.950 --> 01:54.350
I will come back to see you

01:54.479 --> 01:55.410
and let you know.

02:03.310 --> 02:04.310
Let's go, Mother.

02:09.630 --> 02:10.970
Just now, Pingwen

02:11.000 --> 02:11.800
asked me...

02:13.090 --> 02:15.150
"When is Pingyuan getting married?"

02:19.410 --> 02:20.670
Why did he ask about me?

02:21.550 --> 02:22.520
It must be

02:22.520 --> 02:23.360
that Liao girl

02:23.360 --> 02:25.030
pushing him to ask.

02:26.310 --> 02:28.240
Well, actually, I want to ask too.

02:29.870 --> 02:31.560
If the older brother

02:31.910 --> 02:33.190
hasn't married yet,

02:33.630 --> 02:35.680
it's improper for the younger brother

02:35.680 --> 02:36.960
to marry first.

02:38.280 --> 02:39.030
Mother.

02:39.630 --> 02:40.720
You've learned

02:40.750 --> 02:42.280
to beat around the bush now.

02:43.710 --> 02:44.800
I was about to discuss it

02:44.800 --> 02:45.340
with you.

02:47.400 --> 02:48.240
Do you remember

02:48.240 --> 02:49.150
I mentioned to you

02:49.150 --> 02:50.630
a Ms. Chang from Shanxi?

02:57.280 --> 02:58.470
Take your time.

02:59.430 --> 03:00.560
I am listening.

03:11.010 --> 03:15.170
[Chang's Mansion in Pingyao]

03:45.710 --> 03:46.360
Come on.

03:46.870 --> 03:48.730
Practice your blade work with me.

03:49.150 --> 03:50.010
How about this?

03:50.400 --> 03:51.200
Take the blade.

03:51.200 --> 03:52.200
I'll use my palms.

03:52.520 --> 03:52.870
Okay?

03:57.360 --> 03:59.220
Catching a blade with bare hands!

03:59.800 --> 04:02.200
You can only
fail at that once in a lifetime!

04:24.160 --> 04:25.360
What kind of betrothal gift

04:25.360 --> 04:27.090
are we preparing for Ms. Chang?

04:27.510 --> 04:28.160
Mother.

04:28.310 --> 04:29.640
I'll prepare it myself.

04:46.920 --> 04:47.520
Come here.

04:59.310 --> 05:00.170
What are these?

05:00.360 --> 05:01.760
Where did they come from?

05:02.550 --> 05:03.750
One is for you.

05:05.070 --> 05:06.360
One is for Pingwen.

05:06.760 --> 05:08.520
When I married your father,

05:08.750 --> 05:10.320
these were the keepsakes I kept

05:10.320 --> 05:11.560
for you two brothers

05:12.070 --> 05:14.330
to use as betrothal gifts for your wives.

05:14.830 --> 05:16.760
Even when we were nearly starving,

05:17.190 --> 05:18.750
I never dared to pawn them

05:18.810 --> 05:19.920
for food.

05:22.120 --> 05:24.450
Now they can finally serve their purpose.

05:25.040 --> 05:27.430
Consider them a token

05:27.430 --> 05:29.430
left by your father for this family.

05:29.720 --> 05:31.050
As long as they're here,

05:31.270 --> 05:32.400
it's as if he is here.

05:33.520 --> 05:34.980
When I went to the capital,

05:35.510 --> 05:36.970
I wanted to search for him.

05:38.920 --> 05:40.580
Even if only his bones remain,

05:40.750 --> 05:41.810
I'd bring them back

05:42.040 --> 05:43.570
to bury in our family grave.

05:45.970 --> 05:47.870
But both times I went to the capital,

05:47.870 --> 05:49.130
something went wrong.

05:50.390 --> 05:51.520
I am truly unfilial.

05:56.420 --> 05:57.870
After you are married,

05:59.110 --> 06:00.370
and the chance arises,

06:01.040 --> 06:02.240
search for him again.

06:03.290 --> 06:05.200
I don't remember many of the men

06:06.430 --> 06:08.430
who took the exam with him back then.

06:08.600 --> 06:10.160
Some died, some left.

06:12.190 --> 06:14.250
I don't know where his wandering soul

06:14.270 --> 06:15.870
has found its resting place.

06:18.560 --> 06:19.240
Go to sleep.

06:20.120 --> 06:21.180
Tomorrow morning,

06:22.040 --> 06:23.300
you'll be setting off.

06:24.610 --> 06:26.040
Ms. Chang

06:27.270 --> 06:28.930
has suffered greatly for you.

06:30.360 --> 06:31.870
If she scolds you

06:31.870 --> 06:32.840
or complains,

06:33.310 --> 06:34.270
just listen.

06:35.750 --> 06:36.830
I know, Mother.

06:46.000 --> 06:47.870
Once you brothers are married,

06:50.240 --> 06:51.350
when I die,

06:52.310 --> 06:53.510
I can face your father

06:54.750 --> 06:56.190
with some peace of mind.

06:59.480 --> 07:01.600
Stop thinking about things like that.

07:01.600 --> 07:02.560
Sleep well.

07:04.000 --> 07:05.800
I believe that in this lifetime,

07:06.210 --> 07:06.920
I will definitely

07:06.920 --> 07:08.520
find Father's whereabouts.

07:34.500 --> 07:42.690
[Deed Stub]

07:45.120 --> 07:45.870
Ms. Su.

07:46.750 --> 07:47.409
It has been…

07:47.480 --> 07:48.310
It has been a long time.

07:48.310 --> 07:49.430
I heard from your father

07:49.430 --> 07:52.159
you're in charge
of the salt administration now.

07:53.000 --> 07:54.310
We made a bet.

07:56.000 --> 07:56.720
And I won.

07:59.720 --> 08:00.560
Did you?

08:02.720 --> 08:03.720
I find it strange.

08:04.830 --> 08:07.030
Your father clearly had the upper hand.

08:07.280 --> 08:09.410
Why did he let Gu Pingyuan off the hook?

08:09.570 --> 08:10.390
My father said

08:10.920 --> 08:12.630
he wanted to leave me an enemy.

08:12.950 --> 08:14.070
A rival.

08:16.550 --> 08:17.510
Is that so?

08:19.390 --> 08:20.600
Such foresight?

08:26.600 --> 08:28.480
What do you mean by that?

08:29.120 --> 08:30.310
This Gu fellow…

08:31.160 --> 08:32.470
At first, I wondered

08:32.789 --> 08:35.179
if he was the God of Business reborn

08:35.240 --> 08:36.510
with flawless strategies.

08:36.510 --> 08:38.150
Later, I thought otherwise.

08:39.270 --> 08:40.720
In Shanghai this time,

08:41.150 --> 08:42.720
your father went easy on him

08:42.870 --> 08:44.390
and made him famous.

08:45.670 --> 08:47.550
Anhui merchants follow his lead.

08:47.720 --> 08:49.920
He even does business with Westerners.

08:50.910 --> 08:52.910
Those Shanxi big shots

08:53.360 --> 08:54.550
listen to him too.

08:55.550 --> 08:56.410
The way I see it,

08:57.360 --> 08:58.390
your father treats him

08:58.390 --> 09:00.270
even better than he treats you.

09:02.670 --> 09:04.050
Nonsense.

09:04.390 --> 09:05.520
Absolute nonsense.

09:05.870 --> 09:07.120
My father

09:07.480 --> 09:08.760
loathes Gu Pingyuan.

09:09.080 --> 09:10.080
He hates his guts.

09:10.760 --> 09:12.790
We're just chatting here.

09:13.510 --> 09:14.370
Think about it.

09:14.750 --> 09:16.910
When you opened
the draft bank in Shanxi,

09:16.910 --> 09:17.750
you lost one round,

09:17.750 --> 09:19.080
and your father made you pull out.

09:17.800 --> 09:17.920
[Taiping Bank]

09:19.670 --> 09:21.240
With Li Million's fortune,

09:21.320 --> 09:23.240
why give up after one setback?

09:22.780 --> 09:24.250
[Greeting the Zephyr]

09:23.510 --> 09:25.510
It would've been easy to stand firm.

09:25.910 --> 09:27.120
Your withdrawal

09:27.240 --> 09:29.300
let that guy get a foothold in Shanxi.

09:30.200 --> 09:31.570
Then in this Grand Tea Competition,

09:31.570 --> 09:32.670
he easily took

09:32.670 --> 09:34.200
the title of Top Tea Under Heaven.

09:33.610 --> 09:35.510
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

09:35.080 --> 09:36.750
There was luck involved,

09:37.120 --> 09:39.380
but someone was helping him from behind.

09:40.510 --> 09:42.190
I got him sent to Ningguta.

09:42.270 --> 09:43.330
Your father told me

09:43.390 --> 09:45.120
he must not die on the way.

09:46.270 --> 09:48.630
The fight was so intense this time,

09:49.270 --> 09:52.000
yet your father yielded again
at the last moment.

09:52.150 --> 09:53.550
Even a fool

09:53.720 --> 09:55.270
could see something is up.

09:58.720 --> 09:59.450
Impossible.

09:59.720 --> 10:00.450
Impossible.

10:00.670 --> 10:02.600
What you're saying makes no sense.

10:13.000 --> 10:13.720
Ms. Su.

10:14.750 --> 10:16.480
Did my father send you

10:17.240 --> 10:18.770
to drive a wedge between us?

10:21.690 --> 10:23.410
You flatter yourself.

10:24.460 --> 10:25.150
Forget it.

10:25.710 --> 10:27.480
Since you're blissfully ignorant,

10:27.480 --> 10:29.410
there's no point talking about it.

10:35.930 --> 10:37.240
The Jiangnan salt administration

10:37.240 --> 10:38.360
is in your hands now.

10:38.360 --> 10:39.600
I can help you.

10:40.240 --> 10:41.370
But there are things

10:41.440 --> 10:42.640
you must help me with.

10:45.720 --> 10:46.670
I can help you.

10:47.630 --> 10:49.490
But if it's about your rebellion,

10:49.550 --> 10:50.550
leave me out of it.

10:51.270 --> 10:52.550
Look at you, coward.

10:52.960 --> 10:53.840
If the world isn't in chaos,

10:53.840 --> 10:55.270
how will you make money?

10:55.630 --> 10:56.490
Remember that.

10:58.270 --> 10:58.910
Ms. Su.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.960
How do you plan to help me?

11:03.960 --> 11:05.690
Did what I just said make sense?

11:06.750 --> 11:07.480
I don't know.

11:08.150 --> 11:09.510
Then think about it carefully.

11:09.510 --> 11:10.370
That is my help.

11:11.030 --> 11:12.430
Your father's scheme...

11:13.200 --> 11:14.930
even I haven't seen through it.

11:33.550 --> 11:34.240
Come in.

11:43.270 --> 11:44.000
What is it?

11:46.030 --> 11:46.630
Father.

11:47.440 --> 11:48.360
I was just

11:48.630 --> 11:50.450
going through the title deeds.

11:51.240 --> 11:52.440
If you're resting...

11:54.360 --> 11:55.760
I'll come back tomorrow.

11:58.840 --> 11:59.640
Is there more?

12:06.630 --> 12:08.110
Ms. Su came to see me.

12:08.600 --> 12:10.320
She said that in Nanjing,

12:11.200 --> 12:12.060
she can help me.

12:12.630 --> 12:14.030
But I have to help her too.

12:15.550 --> 12:17.150
I just feel uneasy.

12:21.600 --> 12:22.480
Uneasy?

12:26.510 --> 12:28.030
She is meticulous.

12:28.940 --> 12:31.070
If there are problems you can't solve,

12:31.670 --> 12:32.790
tell me.

12:34.320 --> 12:35.240
She said some

12:35.240 --> 12:36.630
baffling things.

12:39.120 --> 12:40.450
I can't figure them out.

12:40.870 --> 12:41.600
Like what?

12:45.750 --> 12:46.550
She said that you gained

12:46.550 --> 12:48.030
the upper hand every time,

12:49.080 --> 12:50.790
yet you intentionally left Gu Pingyuan

12:50.790 --> 12:51.870
a way out.

12:52.960 --> 12:54.600
She said there is more to it.

12:58.480 --> 13:00.000
There is more to it?

13:02.530 --> 13:03.670
What do you think?

13:05.550 --> 13:06.440
I don't know.

13:09.870 --> 13:12.130
You only go all out for a worthy opponent.

13:13.510 --> 13:14.510
He isn't worth it.

13:15.270 --> 13:17.030
I can't let the tea trade of one province

13:17.030 --> 13:18.160
ruin my grand plans.

13:19.150 --> 13:20.210
Do you understand?

13:23.000 --> 13:24.260
I understand, Father.

13:24.750 --> 13:26.410
Every choice has trade-offs.

13:26.550 --> 13:27.750
Business is the same.

13:29.600 --> 13:31.390
This time, I'm staking all my connections

13:31.390 --> 13:32.750
and assets.

13:33.200 --> 13:35.390
Once we secure the Jiangnan salt trade,

13:35.390 --> 13:36.590
you can show the world

13:37.840 --> 13:38.870
what you can do.

13:40.350 --> 13:41.600
To win this battle,

13:42.270 --> 13:43.440
I'd even kneel.

13:44.670 --> 13:46.670
What does admitting defeat matter?

13:48.630 --> 13:49.890
I understand, Father.

13:52.950 --> 13:56.710
[Pingyao, Shanxi]

14:36.000 --> 14:36.720
It's you.

14:37.510 --> 14:38.840
What are you doing here?

14:40.150 --> 14:41.610
I'd like to meet Mr. Chang.

14:46.510 --> 14:47.440
What do you want?

14:47.910 --> 14:49.240
Why are you so annoying?

14:49.510 --> 14:50.150
Who is it?

14:51.910 --> 14:52.840
A beggar!

14:54.670 --> 14:55.870
Gu Pingyuan, let's get this straight.

14:55.870 --> 14:57.900
I heard you got rich
and became an official.

14:57.900 --> 14:59.080
You're proud of yourself,

14:59.080 --> 14:59.840
aren't you?

15:00.950 --> 15:02.330
I know why you're here.

15:02.790 --> 15:03.720
If you leave now,

15:03.860 --> 15:04.600
I, Heizi, will

15:04.600 --> 15:06.120
kowtow to you 100 times.

15:06.440 --> 15:07.080
Okay?

15:07.510 --> 15:08.910
I'm begging you, please.

15:08.910 --> 15:09.480
You...

15:10.240 --> 15:11.000
Heizi.

15:12.440 --> 15:13.120
Heizi!

15:13.520 --> 15:15.120
Go get the guy some food.

15:26.240 --> 15:27.030
I woke up this morning

15:27.030 --> 15:28.390
feeling refreshed and spirited.

15:28.390 --> 15:30.650
Turns out it was because you were coming.

15:31.240 --> 15:31.840
Heizi.

15:32.390 --> 15:33.320
Run to Tianfu Restaurant

15:33.320 --> 15:35.000
and order their finest dishes.

15:35.000 --> 15:36.560
We'll be talking. No time to cook.

15:36.560 --> 15:37.690
Bring the things in.

15:38.000 --> 15:38.560
Yu'er!

15:38.870 --> 15:40.240
Look who's here.

15:40.550 --> 15:41.150
Mr. Chang.

15:41.150 --> 15:42.480
Mr. Chang, don't call Yu'er yet.

15:42.480 --> 15:43.120
This time,

15:43.200 --> 15:44.800
I came on my mother's orders.

15:47.430 --> 15:48.290
Let's talk inside.

15:48.290 --> 15:48.720
Okay.

16:11.550 --> 16:12.610
What are you doing?

16:19.240 --> 16:20.320
I made a mistake!

16:26.150 --> 16:26.670
Mr. Gu.

16:27.320 --> 16:28.150
Check for me.

16:28.390 --> 16:29.250
Is it straight?

16:32.650 --> 16:33.670
Yes, straight.

16:34.370 --> 16:35.900
I rarely pay formal visits.

16:36.000 --> 16:37.460
I don't have fine clothes.

16:37.550 --> 16:39.430
Since you are here
on your mother's orders,

16:39.430 --> 16:41.270
we must observe proper etiquette.

16:41.270 --> 16:41.910
Mr. Gu.

16:42.390 --> 16:43.240
Please, sit.

16:43.960 --> 16:44.890
Speak your mind.

16:45.040 --> 16:45.670
Mr. Chang.

16:46.080 --> 16:46.750
From now on,

16:46.790 --> 16:48.080
you should stop calling me

16:48.080 --> 16:48.670
Mr. Gu.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.020
That's too formal and polite.

16:50.020 --> 16:51.080
Out with it.

16:51.150 --> 16:52.600
I'll call you Big Brother if I have to.

16:52.600 --> 16:54.400
Mr. Chang, don't joke like that.

16:54.630 --> 16:55.120
Come.

16:55.270 --> 16:56.530
Please take your seat.

17:13.270 --> 17:14.270
I, Gu Pingyuan,

17:15.000 --> 17:16.200
by my mother's order,

17:16.270 --> 17:17.730
came to propose marriage.

17:19.430 --> 17:21.160
Mr. Chang, I beg your blessing.

17:21.440 --> 17:23.099
I wish to marry your daughter,

17:23.230 --> 17:24.560
Chang Yu'er, as my wife,

17:25.540 --> 17:27.270
to unite our families forever.

17:33.210 --> 17:35.160
This is the betrothal letter I prepared.

17:35.160 --> 17:36.420
And my birth date card.

17:37.270 --> 17:39.080
I also prepared a betrothal gift.

17:39.080 --> 17:41.080
It's a keepsake from my late father.

17:41.400 --> 17:43.200
My mother said she can't see well

17:43.240 --> 17:44.640
and has trouble walking,

17:45.030 --> 17:46.890
so I must deliver the gift myself.

17:47.160 --> 17:48.620
My manners may be lacking.

17:49.840 --> 17:51.500
Mr. Chang, please forgive me.

18:11.350 --> 18:12.810
You really are something.

18:15.350 --> 18:17.420
I knew this day would come.

18:20.720 --> 18:21.830
Why did you wait until now

18:21.830 --> 18:23.360
to marry my daughter?

18:23.480 --> 18:25.550
She's been waiting for ages.

18:26.310 --> 18:27.400
I was a convict.

18:28.580 --> 18:29.880
Thanks to you and Miss Chang,

18:29.880 --> 18:30.810
I'm still alive.

18:31.550 --> 18:32.590
Before, at home,

18:33.240 --> 18:35.070
there were old scores unsettled.

18:35.070 --> 18:36.000
I dared not come.

18:36.110 --> 18:38.000
Mr. Gu, please rise.

18:41.330 --> 18:42.180
Mr. Chang.

18:42.890 --> 18:43.880
Stop calling me

18:44.730 --> 18:45.600
Mr. Gu.

18:45.960 --> 18:47.410
Old habits die hard.

18:47.960 --> 18:48.960
Today,

18:49.400 --> 18:51.440
I really didn't expect this.

18:53.680 --> 18:55.240
Yu'er always says

18:55.430 --> 18:57.510
she wants to support me until I die.

18:57.830 --> 18:59.110
But I am old

18:59.240 --> 19:00.200
and a burden to her.

19:00.200 --> 19:01.640
I feel uneasy about it.

19:02.390 --> 19:03.480
To tell you the truth,

19:03.480 --> 19:04.830
I wish I could immediately

19:04.830 --> 19:06.240
go on a long-distance trade run.

19:06.240 --> 19:07.430
Even to Tianshan.

19:07.510 --> 19:08.910
Even if I died on the road,

19:09.070 --> 19:10.090
it'd be better than

19:10.090 --> 19:11.180
watching her

19:11.400 --> 19:13.080
be depressed every day.

19:18.110 --> 19:18.920
Look at me.

19:19.240 --> 19:20.830
I'm getting old,

19:21.160 --> 19:22.110
going a bit crazy.

19:22.110 --> 19:24.240
Crying one moment, laughing the next.

19:26.640 --> 19:27.960
Go tell her now.

19:32.880 --> 19:33.720
Yu'er!

19:34.510 --> 19:35.640
Where are you going?

19:37.200 --> 19:38.510
She is a girl.

19:39.110 --> 19:40.480
Let her cry it out.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.150
After she cries,

19:42.240 --> 19:43.590
she will feel better.

19:43.830 --> 19:44.640
Don't go.

19:47.680 --> 19:52.270
♪ Tea picking in January
marks the new year ♪

19:53.030 --> 19:54.640
♪ Tea picking in February ♪

19:54.640 --> 19:55.510
What's with you?

19:55.510 --> 19:56.790
Grinning like a fool.

19:57.420 --> 19:58.110
I'm happy.

19:59.920 --> 20:00.970
You can't fool me.

20:01.200 --> 20:02.070
It must be because your mother

20:02.070 --> 20:03.800
has been smiling at you lately.

20:04.000 --> 20:06.070
If anyone's happy, it's your brother.

20:06.070 --> 20:07.640
All his suffering has finally paid off.

20:07.640 --> 20:09.440
You surely never went to school.

20:09.640 --> 20:11.000
This is called proper hierarchy.

20:11.000 --> 20:11.830
When parents are alive,

20:11.830 --> 20:13.030
children shouldn't travel far.

20:13.030 --> 20:13.790
If my brother is single,

20:13.790 --> 20:14.590
I stay unwed.

20:15.920 --> 20:17.310
You surely are.

20:21.830 --> 20:23.430
Your brother isn't back yet?

20:23.920 --> 20:25.640
I told the assistants down the mountain

20:25.640 --> 20:27.140
to wait at the dock, morning and night.

20:27.140 --> 20:29.070
Once he's back, I'll go pick him up.

20:29.640 --> 20:30.900
Thank you for the meal.

20:31.000 --> 20:32.200
It's the least I could do.

20:32.200 --> 20:32.960
This time,

20:32.960 --> 20:34.550
Pingyuan is finally seeing better days.

20:34.550 --> 20:36.510
This is the best news in the world.

20:36.880 --> 20:38.230
I am clumsy sometimes.

20:38.400 --> 20:39.350
If I missed anything,

20:39.350 --> 20:40.800
don't scold me.

20:42.440 --> 20:43.030
Mother.

20:43.270 --> 20:44.680
I heard my sister-in-law

20:44.750 --> 20:46.030
comes from a martial background.

20:46.030 --> 20:47.110
An expert fighter.

20:49.160 --> 20:50.350
We two brothers

20:50.960 --> 20:51.680
just don't have the fate

20:51.680 --> 20:53.680
to have gentle, considerate wives.

20:54.310 --> 20:54.960
I'll beat you up.

20:54.960 --> 20:55.680
I dare you!

20:57.530 --> 20:59.240
Why did you brew the guest tea?

21:00.200 --> 21:01.530
Switch to the rough tea.

21:01.750 --> 21:02.370
Mother.

21:02.550 --> 21:04.240
We won't drink that tea anymore.

21:04.240 --> 21:05.380
Haven't you heard?

21:05.450 --> 21:06.830
Pingyuan made a name for himself

21:06.830 --> 21:08.090
in Shanghai this time.

21:08.110 --> 21:09.510
You remember Hou Er, right?

21:09.510 --> 21:11.080
He used to be so arrogant.

21:11.200 --> 21:12.280
Now, when he sees me

21:12.350 --> 21:13.280
from a mile away,

21:13.440 --> 21:14.720
he hangs his head like a whipped dog.

21:14.720 --> 21:15.550
"Mr. Pingwen."

21:15.550 --> 21:16.470
"Mr. Pingwen."

21:16.830 --> 21:18.110
I used to be just Gu Pingwen,

21:18.110 --> 21:19.590
but now I'm Mr. Pingwen.

21:20.790 --> 21:22.680
This respect wasn't given to us.

21:22.720 --> 21:24.110
We earned it ourselves.

21:24.270 --> 21:25.830
Back then, on the dragon boat,

21:25.830 --> 21:26.930
we nearly died.

21:27.070 --> 21:28.400
As they say, "Survive a great disaster,

21:28.400 --> 21:30.200
and great fortune will follow."

21:30.590 --> 21:31.790
That tea smells wonderful.

21:31.790 --> 21:33.020
Pour me a cup of it.

21:40.240 --> 21:41.760
Sir, you are…

21:45.110 --> 21:45.870
Pingwen.

21:45.960 --> 21:47.680
Pour some tea for the guest.

21:51.410 --> 21:52.290
Sir.

21:52.750 --> 21:54.550
Are you looking to rest your feet

21:54.920 --> 21:56.890
or join us for a meal?

21:58.160 --> 21:59.240
Old Madam Gu.

22:00.710 --> 22:01.880
My surname is Wu.

22:02.030 --> 22:02.680
I came over

22:02.720 --> 22:04.480
on behalf of my good friend, Gu Pingyuan,

22:04.480 --> 22:05.880
to take a look at the bridal chamber.

22:05.880 --> 22:07.440
I'm afraid he won't have time to prepare,

22:07.440 --> 22:08.480
and the bride might feel slighted.

22:08.480 --> 22:08.880
So

22:08.880 --> 22:10.160
I rushed over here

22:10.200 --> 22:11.880
without giving you prior notice.

22:11.880 --> 22:13.480
Please forgive my intrusion.

22:13.480 --> 22:15.210
You must be the "God of Wealth."

22:16.120 --> 22:17.180
What God of Wealth?

22:17.210 --> 22:19.750
[Spring Breeze of Yi River]

22:17.510 --> 22:19.830
That's just a nickname people gave me

22:19.990 --> 22:20.860
to flatter me.

22:21.000 --> 22:22.160
I dare not accept it.

22:22.750 --> 22:23.280
I

22:23.310 --> 22:25.320
have the most debt in the world.

22:25.880 --> 22:27.290
I can't be called the God of Wealth.

22:27.290 --> 22:28.110
At best,

22:28.510 --> 22:29.790
I'm the God of Debt.

22:32.400 --> 22:34.320
He has such a good friend,

22:34.350 --> 22:36.000
but he never told us.

22:36.640 --> 22:37.170
Pingwen.

22:37.400 --> 22:39.070
Add a pair of chopsticks,

22:39.170 --> 22:40.430
and cook another dish.

22:40.750 --> 22:41.310
Come.

22:41.180 --> 22:47.180
[Spring Breeze of Yi River]

22:41.400 --> 22:42.510
Eat with us.

22:42.850 --> 22:43.480
Sure.

22:43.810 --> 22:45.010
I happen to be hungry.

22:45.100 --> 22:46.450
There are a few eggs left.

22:46.450 --> 22:47.350
I'll go fry them.

22:47.350 --> 22:47.860
No need.

22:47.880 --> 22:49.000
This is good enough.

22:49.000 --> 22:50.500
It's fine. It'll be quick.

22:51.250 --> 22:52.560
I'll take this bowl.

22:52.590 --> 22:53.240
Sure.

22:53.270 --> 22:54.270
No one has used it.

22:54.310 --> 22:55.400
Here.

22:55.790 --> 22:56.680
Alright.

23:09.720 --> 23:10.550
Sir.

23:11.430 --> 23:12.490
Good or bad?

23:12.640 --> 23:13.640
Just say it.

23:14.960 --> 23:15.860
Don't rush.

23:16.000 --> 23:17.510
Maybe he calculated wrong.

23:17.510 --> 23:19.030
Mr. Chang, I've kowtowed to you.

23:19.030 --> 23:19.510
No matter what,

23:19.510 --> 23:21.170
you have to let me marry Yu'er.

23:21.200 --> 23:22.550
I'll face whatever difficulties come.

23:22.550 --> 23:22.920
Okay.

23:24.720 --> 23:26.780
Mr. Gu's fate

23:27.310 --> 23:28.720
is not very good.

23:29.400 --> 23:31.720
Others will become pillars of society.

23:31.750 --> 23:34.240
Why doesn't the scholar return home early?

23:34.550 --> 23:36.310
You will toil your whole life

23:36.400 --> 23:37.880
and rarely return home.

23:42.820 --> 23:44.920
This young lady's fate

23:46.410 --> 23:48.320
is also strange.

23:49.000 --> 23:51.510
Body and soul held in others' gaze.

23:51.640 --> 23:54.030
A lone boat drifting in the dark.

23:54.550 --> 23:57.160
If longing turns to stormy weather,

23:57.480 --> 24:00.110
who can easily find love?

24:00.310 --> 24:01.070
Isn't this

24:01.880 --> 24:04.270
utterly bizarre?

24:06.510 --> 24:09.880
It means the first half of life
drifting in storms

24:10.070 --> 24:14.000
and the second half in solitary longing.

24:14.070 --> 24:14.960
No, wait. What?

24:15.160 --> 24:16.220
Solitary longing?

24:16.350 --> 24:17.210
I am right here.

24:17.240 --> 24:18.040
What longing?

24:18.400 --> 24:18.920
Sir.

24:19.070 --> 24:21.590
Read these two horoscopes together.

24:22.270 --> 24:24.160
Don't rush.

24:25.030 --> 24:26.950
When these two fates

24:27.200 --> 24:28.820
are combined…

24:29.720 --> 24:33.470
Once they meet, no matter where or when,

24:33.550 --> 24:37.440
they find their true selves in each other.

24:38.240 --> 24:41.440
It means husband and wife
will stay together

24:41.550 --> 24:44.580
until the end of their days.

24:45.270 --> 24:46.510
I told you so!

24:46.640 --> 24:47.350
Heizi.

24:47.730 --> 24:49.730
Take the gentleman to get some food.

24:49.790 --> 24:50.450
Here, here.

24:50.640 --> 24:51.840
Take this red packet.

24:52.350 --> 24:53.590
Thank you. Thank you.

24:54.130 --> 24:55.110
Please.

24:55.550 --> 24:56.480
Farewell.

24:59.110 --> 24:59.720
Back when I was

24:59.720 --> 25:01.250
down and out in my hometown,

25:01.270 --> 25:03.270
I ate "door-plank meals" every day.

25:03.690 --> 25:04.830
Thinking about it now,

25:04.830 --> 25:05.760
it wasn't so bad.

25:06.000 --> 25:07.060
I actually miss it.

25:07.960 --> 25:09.480
What is a door-plank meal?

25:11.370 --> 25:12.890
For a door-plank meal,

25:12.960 --> 25:14.270
I'd go into restaurants

25:14.270 --> 25:15.640
after customers have finished eating

25:15.640 --> 25:17.310
and eat up whatever's left

25:17.350 --> 25:19.070
on their plates.

25:21.240 --> 25:22.240
Is this the place?

25:22.780 --> 25:25.260
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

25:23.790 --> 25:25.050
Come on. Guys, come in.

25:31.960 --> 25:33.540
You're finally here.

25:33.720 --> 25:35.000
Everyone here?

25:35.110 --> 25:35.930
Yes.
Yes.

25:36.000 --> 25:36.960
All here.

25:37.640 --> 25:38.500
Listen to me.

25:38.920 --> 25:39.880
When you go in,

25:39.960 --> 25:40.880
first, clean up

25:40.880 --> 25:41.880
the main room

25:41.880 --> 25:43.200
and Old Madam Gu's room.

25:43.200 --> 25:44.420
Be gentle and quiet.

25:44.510 --> 25:45.110
Before dark,

25:45.110 --> 25:46.440
Old Madam Gu needs to use it.

25:46.440 --> 25:47.240
If she feels even a bit

25:47.240 --> 25:48.250
of discomfort,

25:48.680 --> 25:49.550
I won't have it.

25:50.030 --> 25:50.750
Then

25:50.750 --> 25:52.820
check inside and out,

25:52.880 --> 25:53.720
the courtyard and surroundings,

25:53.720 --> 25:55.310
up and down, front and back.

25:55.310 --> 25:56.510
Inspect everything.

25:56.960 --> 25:59.090
Replace anything broken with new ones.

25:59.090 --> 26:00.520
In short,

26:00.830 --> 26:02.030
renovate this house

26:02.030 --> 26:03.200
until it looks brand new.

26:03.200 --> 26:04.030
This house is

26:04.030 --> 26:05.430
for my friend's wedding.

26:05.720 --> 26:06.510
Don't let my friend

26:06.510 --> 26:07.240
have any reason

26:07.240 --> 26:08.160
to be dissatisfied.

26:08.160 --> 26:09.400
-Mr. Wu.
-Do you understand?

26:09.400 --> 26:10.200
-Yes.
-Yes, sir.

26:10.200 --> 26:10.590
Move.

26:10.640 --> 26:13.310
-This is too much.
-Well, I'll take you there.

26:14.640 --> 26:16.110
-Pingwen.
-Thank you.

26:16.410 --> 26:16.920
Mr. Wu.

26:17.030 --> 26:18.000
This… This is too much.

26:18.000 --> 26:18.960
This is too much.

26:19.240 --> 26:20.370
It's not too much at all.

26:20.370 --> 26:21.100
Old Madam Gu,

26:21.200 --> 26:22.370
it's the least I can do.

26:22.370 --> 26:23.290
As you said,

26:23.480 --> 26:24.400
we aren't some

26:24.420 --> 26:25.750
wealthy, noble family.

26:25.790 --> 26:26.920
As long as everything is fixed up

26:26.920 --> 26:28.400
to look presentable, that's enough.

26:28.400 --> 26:29.160
Don't worry.

26:29.600 --> 26:30.960
These are all

26:30.960 --> 26:32.170
top craftsmen I hired from Hangzhou.

26:32.170 --> 26:33.370
They won't mess it up.

26:34.070 --> 26:34.860
They…

26:34.960 --> 26:35.590
They…

26:37.240 --> 26:39.590
I traveled thousands of miles to get here.

26:39.610 --> 26:41.410
It's just a little kind gesture.

26:41.550 --> 26:42.340
Old Madam Gu.

26:42.510 --> 26:43.960
Please indulge me.

26:48.030 --> 26:49.000
Mr. Gu.

26:50.070 --> 26:52.070
Let's go over the Three Letters

26:52.400 --> 26:53.200
and Six Rites.

26:53.440 --> 26:54.310
We clap if we both agree.

26:54.310 --> 26:54.750
Okay.

26:56.720 --> 26:58.640
I've already written the betrothal letter.

26:58.640 --> 26:58.960
In a bit,

26:58.960 --> 27:00.350
I'll send it to Yu'er.

27:00.590 --> 27:01.520
The gift letter…

27:01.790 --> 27:02.990
The gift list is here.

27:03.390 --> 27:05.450
[Gift List]

27:03.510 --> 27:05.000
It's a bit long. Take a look.

27:05.000 --> 27:06.240
As long as there is one, it's fine.

27:06.240 --> 27:07.030
I'll put it here for now.

27:07.030 --> 27:07.790
As for the wedding letter,

27:07.790 --> 27:09.030
it's used on the wedding day.

27:09.030 --> 27:10.160
We don't need it now.

27:10.350 --> 27:11.950
Those are the Three Letters.

27:12.790 --> 27:14.140
Now for the Six Rites.

27:14.400 --> 27:15.110
The first

27:15.270 --> 27:16.200
is the proposal.

27:16.350 --> 27:18.030
The matchmaker's visit.

27:18.510 --> 27:19.570
Since you are here…

27:19.590 --> 27:20.270
It counts.

27:20.480 --> 27:21.940
I act as my own matchmaker.

27:23.440 --> 27:24.110
Second

27:24.240 --> 27:25.350
is birthdate matching.

27:25.350 --> 27:26.480
The fortune teller just now

27:26.480 --> 27:27.400
already checked your horoscopes.

27:27.400 --> 27:28.400
No problem there.

27:29.110 --> 27:30.110
Third

27:30.640 --> 27:31.510
is divination—

27:31.720 --> 27:33.550
picking the wedding date.

27:33.830 --> 27:35.560
We will do that back in Huizhou.

27:37.070 --> 27:37.790
Fourth

27:38.000 --> 27:39.400
is presenting the gifts.

27:41.350 --> 27:41.950
Mr. Chang.

27:42.590 --> 27:44.440
This is my late father's keepsake.

27:44.440 --> 27:45.300
Keep it for now.

27:45.350 --> 27:47.590
Give it to Yu'er later.

27:47.890 --> 27:49.000
So that's settled.

27:51.960 --> 27:53.210
Fifth

27:53.310 --> 27:54.510
is setting the wedding date.

27:54.510 --> 27:57.040
Both sides need to agree on a date.

27:57.230 --> 27:58.030
I totally agree.

27:58.030 --> 27:58.920
I agree too.

28:00.870 --> 28:02.160
And the last one

28:02.200 --> 28:03.530
is welcoming the bride.

28:03.920 --> 28:04.980
On the wedding day,

28:05.440 --> 28:08.110
the groom needs
to bring the bride to his home.

28:08.750 --> 28:09.310
Done.

28:09.910 --> 28:10.830
No problems, right?

28:10.830 --> 28:11.790
If I don't bring her,

28:11.790 --> 28:13.390
does she walk there herself?

28:13.440 --> 28:14.030
Come on.

28:15.750 --> 28:16.230
Cheers.

28:16.420 --> 28:17.730
Cheers.

28:31.400 --> 28:32.000
Mr. Chang.

28:32.470 --> 28:33.070
Why hasn't Yu'er

28:33.070 --> 28:34.400
come over to eat with us?

28:36.880 --> 28:37.920
She's a girl.

28:38.570 --> 28:40.320
We're discussing her marriage.

28:40.320 --> 28:41.700
She's bound to be shy.

28:42.830 --> 28:43.830
Skipping a meal won't hurt.

28:43.830 --> 28:44.700
Come on.

28:45.860 --> 28:47.320
We've been talking all this time,

28:47.320 --> 28:47.920
but it seems we're just

28:47.920 --> 28:49.050
amusing ourselves.

28:49.470 --> 28:51.150
We haven't asked the girl involved.

28:51.150 --> 28:51.950
That's right.

28:53.900 --> 28:56.420
I felt something was missing too.

28:56.740 --> 28:57.600
It's fine.

28:58.240 --> 28:59.350
Go ask her yourself.

28:59.350 --> 29:00.950
I'll wait for you to drink.

29:02.460 --> 29:04.390
Hurry up, or the food will get cold.

29:04.550 --> 29:05.030
Wait.

29:05.070 --> 29:06.000
What should I do?

29:06.350 --> 29:08.340
Give her the betrothal letter and gifts.

29:08.340 --> 29:09.200
Then come back.

29:09.280 --> 29:10.480
She's in the room across the way.

29:10.480 --> 29:10.920
Go on.

29:11.070 --> 29:11.830
That simple?

29:12.110 --> 29:14.440
It's not some royal princess
getting married.

29:14.440 --> 29:15.800
We're poor folk.

29:15.880 --> 29:17.110
It's not that complicated.

29:17.110 --> 29:17.790
Go on.

29:30.590 --> 29:31.240
Yu'er.

29:33.110 --> 29:34.090
I have something for you.

29:34.090 --> 29:34.610
Yu'er.

29:45.720 --> 29:46.590
Just now,

29:47.160 --> 29:49.560
I was going over the rituals
with Mr. Chang.

29:49.680 --> 29:51.610
I didn't come to see you right away.

29:51.960 --> 29:53.360
Don't hold it against me.

29:56.920 --> 29:57.680
Back at Shanhai Pass,

29:57.680 --> 29:58.810
when we parted ways,

29:58.880 --> 29:59.810
didn't I tell you

30:00.680 --> 30:02.550
as soon as I had a moment to breathe,

30:02.550 --> 30:03.550
I'd come find you?

30:05.200 --> 30:05.790
Yu'er.

30:12.070 --> 30:12.830
Yu'er.

30:15.400 --> 30:16.440
Are you hungry?

30:17.160 --> 30:18.890
Do you want to go eat something?

30:21.920 --> 30:22.440
Sir.

30:22.790 --> 30:24.000
Thank you.

30:25.530 --> 30:26.920
Have some water.

30:26.960 --> 30:27.560
Rest a bit.

30:29.380 --> 30:30.030
Here, sir.

30:30.270 --> 30:32.090
Easy does it. Take it slow.

30:32.160 --> 30:33.690
Watch your safety up there.

30:33.960 --> 30:35.070
Have some water.

30:37.830 --> 30:38.520
Thank you.

30:40.550 --> 30:41.550
Thanks.

30:43.480 --> 30:44.480
God of Wealth.

30:44.790 --> 30:45.930
These materials...

30:46.030 --> 30:47.430
we have them locally too.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.070
Why ship them

30:48.070 --> 30:49.270
all the way from Zhejiang?

30:49.270 --> 30:50.330
You have them here?

30:51.110 --> 30:52.270
I don't think so.

30:53.480 --> 30:55.340
Take this white mud for instance.

30:55.350 --> 30:57.640
It's made from sticky rice pulp
and limestone,

30:57.640 --> 30:59.170
pounded ten thousand times

30:59.390 --> 31:00.990
and washed perfectly clean.

31:01.440 --> 31:03.350
Pointing the walls with it
prevents termites.

31:03.350 --> 31:04.410
As for weathering,

31:05.000 --> 31:06.930
I won't claim it lasts 1,000 years,

31:06.960 --> 31:08.960
but several hundred years for sure.

31:09.960 --> 31:10.880
Only Zhejiang people

31:10.880 --> 31:12.160
know how to make it.

31:12.660 --> 31:13.400
I especially

31:13.400 --> 31:14.720
went to an old craftsman

31:14.720 --> 31:16.500
and used his old stock

31:16.590 --> 31:17.830
just for this.

31:19.540 --> 31:20.720
Mr. Gu

31:20.880 --> 31:21.590
just doesn't know

31:21.590 --> 31:22.900
how to deal with women.

31:22.940 --> 31:24.680
He can't learn that.

31:26.480 --> 31:28.280
The grand ceremony is prepared.

31:28.680 --> 31:30.400
A fine union is established.

31:31.070 --> 31:33.600
With deep affection
like inseparable birds,

31:33.680 --> 31:36.430
may we have respect for each other.

31:37.310 --> 31:39.110
May we be blessed with fertility

31:39.130 --> 31:41.320
and prosperity for our descendants.

31:41.680 --> 31:43.210
With one heart and one mind,

31:43.270 --> 31:45.000
may we build a harmonious home.

31:45.400 --> 31:46.960
May we be united forever

31:47.270 --> 31:48.790
as a loving couple,

31:49.480 --> 31:51.030
like in the poem of Guan Ju

31:51.270 --> 31:53.160
and the elegant song of Lin Zhi.

31:54.270 --> 31:56.640
May prosperity last for five generations,

31:56.640 --> 31:58.960
and our virtue spread like the classics.

31:59.070 --> 32:00.590
Respect each other

32:00.850 --> 32:04.050
and enjoy harmonious intimacy forever.

32:05.550 --> 32:07.310
Help each other with sincerity,

32:07.310 --> 32:09.750
and pledge our love like mandarin ducks.

32:10.030 --> 32:12.890
Rejoice that today,
the red thread binds us

32:12.920 --> 32:14.450
in a perfect union,

32:14.720 --> 32:17.750
and may we grow old together

32:17.920 --> 32:20.110
with fragrant happiness.

32:22.200 --> 32:23.260
In witness hereof.

32:37.310 --> 32:37.880
Yu'er.

32:38.400 --> 32:40.260
I also prepared a betrothal gift.

32:41.240 --> 32:42.000
It is a keepsake my father

32:42.000 --> 32:43.240
left for the family.

32:46.770 --> 32:50.140
[Chang]

33:06.400 --> 33:07.160
Yu'er.

33:09.350 --> 33:11.210
What exactly are you upset about?

33:11.570 --> 33:12.970
Open the door and tell me.

33:14.990 --> 33:16.120
I'm not very clever.

33:17.000 --> 33:18.860
I can't guess if you don't tell me.

33:20.960 --> 33:22.680
We have faced death together.

33:23.900 --> 33:25.400
You can tell me anything.

33:28.790 --> 33:29.550
I admit

33:30.200 --> 33:31.270
I am a bit dense.

33:34.110 --> 33:36.110
I thought it through on the way here.

33:37.940 --> 33:39.200
Since I'm here,

33:40.710 --> 33:42.170
all those past matters...

33:44.110 --> 33:45.910
I've left them outside the door.

33:48.160 --> 33:49.090
For any previous

33:50.270 --> 33:51.000
thoughtlessness

33:51.000 --> 33:52.460
or disrespect toward you,

33:54.640 --> 33:56.160
if you feel upset,

33:57.870 --> 33:58.930
just open the door.

34:00.270 --> 34:01.470
Come out and scold me.

34:02.110 --> 34:02.920
Hit me.

34:03.640 --> 34:04.640
Anything is fine.

34:05.950 --> 34:07.280
As long as you are happy.

34:12.280 --> 34:13.000
Yu'er.

34:18.290 --> 34:19.150
Stop talking.

34:19.510 --> 34:20.570
I'm going to sleep.

34:44.290 --> 34:51.389
[Chang]

35:09.400 --> 35:10.000
Yu'er.

35:10.590 --> 35:11.760
You two

35:11.780 --> 35:13.510
have been drinking since noon.

35:13.510 --> 35:14.320
You stayed behind

35:14.320 --> 35:15.520
closed doors all day.

35:15.760 --> 35:17.590
We were drinking while waiting for you.

35:17.590 --> 35:18.760
Mr. Chang was already drunk.

35:18.760 --> 35:19.890
I told him to go rest.

35:20.440 --> 35:22.170
He insisted on waiting with me.

35:22.190 --> 35:24.050
So we drank until he got like this.

35:25.030 --> 35:25.880
Great.

35:26.590 --> 35:27.980
When you're not here,

35:28.110 --> 35:29.150
I let my father drink

35:29.150 --> 35:30.510
only a little every day.

35:30.630 --> 35:31.710
Once I closed my door today,

35:31.710 --> 35:33.110
you two really let loose.

35:33.150 --> 35:34.000
He is old.

35:34.030 --> 35:35.430
He can't drink this much.

35:41.480 --> 35:43.280
Mr. Chang was a hero all his life.

35:43.360 --> 35:44.360
Now that he's old,

35:44.510 --> 35:46.150
he has to take attitude from his child.

35:46.150 --> 35:47.750
Who dares give him attitude?

35:50.550 --> 35:51.150
Yu'er.

35:52.230 --> 35:52.840
Sit down.

35:53.280 --> 35:54.190
Talk to me.

35:58.360 --> 35:59.150
What for?

36:02.280 --> 36:02.710
I came here

36:02.710 --> 36:04.640
to deliver the marriage proposal.

36:05.210 --> 36:06.870
Why are you so annoyed with me?

36:07.530 --> 36:08.480
Are you smug?

36:09.030 --> 36:10.590
Waiting for me to kowtow and thank you?

36:10.590 --> 36:11.230
No.

36:12.590 --> 36:13.520
I wouldn't dare.

36:15.000 --> 36:16.360
I hope you'll agree.

36:18.150 --> 36:19.400
I agree?

36:19.810 --> 36:21.230
Even my father thinks

36:21.320 --> 36:22.280
if I don't accept you,

36:22.280 --> 36:23.320
I'd be ungrateful

36:23.360 --> 36:24.190
and foolish.

36:24.590 --> 36:25.920
I find it strange.

36:26.480 --> 36:28.030
Back then, when you left,

36:28.360 --> 36:29.670
my father called you a hero,

36:29.670 --> 36:30.440
a good man.

36:30.720 --> 36:32.190
Now you've come to propose,

36:32.190 --> 36:33.400
and he still calls you a hero,

36:33.400 --> 36:34.110
a good man.

36:34.670 --> 36:35.480
Why do you men

36:35.480 --> 36:36.510
have 1,000 excuses for everything

36:36.510 --> 36:38.110
while whatever I do is wrong?

36:38.440 --> 36:39.640
Truly hypocritical.

36:44.550 --> 36:45.150
Right.

36:45.630 --> 36:46.230
Well said.

36:46.590 --> 36:47.320
Well said.

36:58.550 --> 36:59.670
If you still feel

36:59.710 --> 37:01.150
bound by debts of gratitude,

37:01.150 --> 37:02.550
you don't have to be here.

37:05.030 --> 37:05.840
My father saved you.

37:05.840 --> 37:06.760
You saved him.

37:07.190 --> 37:09.030
Now he has retired.

37:09.840 --> 37:10.800
The messy scores

37:11.230 --> 37:12.760
are better left unsettled.

37:16.000 --> 37:17.400
As for my feelings,

37:18.030 --> 37:19.360
that's my own business.

37:21.190 --> 37:22.800
I never asked anything of you.

37:22.800 --> 37:24.200
So don't take it to heart.

37:24.840 --> 37:25.440
Yu'er.

37:26.560 --> 37:27.960
What do you mean by that?

37:32.110 --> 37:32.840
I...

37:36.190 --> 37:37.110
I...

37:38.880 --> 37:40.280
I thought of you

37:41.940 --> 37:43.320
day and night.

37:45.520 --> 37:47.030
But it was never like this.

37:50.840 --> 37:52.040
Then what was it like?

37:57.770 --> 37:58.910
It was...

38:03.150 --> 38:04.190
Your eyes.

38:06.280 --> 38:07.150
Brows.

38:09.420 --> 38:10.320
Teeth.

38:11.200 --> 38:12.800
If you are reborn in another life,

38:12.800 --> 38:13.880
even among thousands of people,

38:13.880 --> 38:15.740
I could recognize you at a glance.

38:18.000 --> 38:18.710
I...

38:20.840 --> 38:23.170
I never expected
to marry you in this life.

38:25.710 --> 38:26.400
Yu'er.

38:28.140 --> 38:29.550
Today feels like a dream.

38:29.570 --> 38:30.070
I...

38:30.440 --> 38:31.840
I'm speaking nonsense.

38:35.590 --> 38:36.150
What

38:37.190 --> 38:38.190
are you afraid of?

38:38.800 --> 38:40.530
I'm afraid this is just a dream.

38:42.550 --> 38:45.550
I'm more afraid your feelings
aren't the same as mine.

38:45.840 --> 38:47.370
Does this look like a dream?

38:49.360 --> 38:50.560
Are dreams this real?

38:50.670 --> 38:52.150
Sometimes dreams are this real.

38:52.150 --> 38:53.010
You don't know.

38:53.150 --> 38:54.000
I know.

38:55.230 --> 38:56.360
Of course I know.

39:00.400 --> 39:01.550
Waking up...

39:03.510 --> 39:04.910
with a heart full of pain.

39:07.400 --> 39:08.360
Some words

39:10.110 --> 39:11.510
cannot be said to others.

39:17.370 --> 39:19.420
If I hadn't been woken up,

39:20.400 --> 39:21.150
I really don't know

39:21.150 --> 39:22.800
how long I'd stay confused.

39:24.800 --> 39:26.330
Someone as smart as you

39:27.550 --> 39:29.060
needs waking up?

39:31.320 --> 39:31.920
Then…

39:33.800 --> 39:35.930
how are the rest of us supposed to live?

39:47.360 --> 39:48.480
Don't mess with me.

39:49.800 --> 39:50.880
Earlier,

39:52.320 --> 39:53.110
your betrothal letter…

39:53.110 --> 39:55.310
I didn't understand a single word of it.

40:01.190 --> 40:03.050
I want to hear your true feelings.

40:04.110 --> 40:04.970
True feelings?

40:07.360 --> 40:07.960
Alright.

40:11.570 --> 40:12.260
You...

40:19.660 --> 40:21.260
You are unforgettable to me.

40:24.210 --> 40:25.300
Meeting you

40:26.810 --> 40:28.940
is the most memorable thing in my life.

40:32.000 --> 40:33.360
All my true feelings

40:35.080 --> 40:36.810
can be expressed in four words.

40:38.960 --> 40:39.710
You are...

40:43.110 --> 40:44.480
etched in my heart.

41:05.500 --> 41:06.610
Me too.

41:38.170 --> 41:39.110
I can't take it anymore.

41:39.110 --> 41:40.040
I can't stand it.

41:40.610 --> 41:41.810
I'm done pretending.

41:42.800 --> 41:43.400
Too tired.

41:44.000 --> 41:45.000
Too tired.

42:08.270 --> 42:13.230
[Gu's Mansion]

42:13.340 --> 42:15.100
[Bright and Virtuous]

42:24.930 --> 42:29.240
[Happiness]

42:49.190 --> 42:51.900
[Gu's Mansion]
